WEBVTT

00:10:29.333 --> 00:10:32.294
when this huge defender
launched himself onto my back,

00:10:32.336 --> 00:10:34.880
I tried to take a few steps,
but I went down.

00:10:36.382 --> 00:10:39.635
It's still the most liberating
feeling in my life,

00:10:39.677 --> 00:10:42.304
getting back up, knowing that I'm OK.

00:10:44.515 --> 00:10:47.935
I'm proud that I made it back
out onto the field,

00:10:47.976 --> 00:10:50.270
but I'm more proud of what got me there.

00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:52.648
Not the physical journey,
but the mental one.

00:10:53.899 --> 00:10:58.404
I've learned that so much of the anxiety
that holds us back in life,

00:10:58.445 --> 00:10:59.988
it's self-inflicted.